# A KQL-only kind says it is not supported yet instead of a did-you-mean.
mode: check
schema: t(customerId: string, month: datetime, revenue: real, n: long)
---- query
from t
| render anomalychart
---- expected
error[DS5003]: the chart kind `anomalychart` is not supported yet
  --> query:2:10
  |
2 | | render anomalychart
  |          ^^^^^^^^^^^^ a KQL chart kind DataScript cannot draw yet
  |
  = note: the chart kinds are table, timechart, linechart, areachart, barchart, columnchart, piechart, scatterchart, card
